    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Enable customers to pay for products using a deposit or a partial payment.</p>\n<h3>Privacy / Data Collection</h3>\n<p>This plugin does not send personal data to third-party services by default.</p>\n<h3>Uninstall</h3>\n<p>When uninstalled, the plugin removes its main options (<code>bdfwbp_installed</code> and <code>bdfwbp_deposits_settings</code>).</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin to your <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory, or install it via the WordPress Plugins screen.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Bright Deposits Settings to configure the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<p>Initial release.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Ultimate Bright Deposits for WooCommerce.",
    "description": "<p>Enable customers to pay for products using a deposit or a partial payment.</p>\n<h3>Privacy / Data Collection</h3>\n<p>This plugin does not send personal data to third-party services by default.</p>\n<h3>Uninstall</h3>\n<p>When uninstalled, the plugin removes its main options (<code>bdfwbp_installed</code> and <code>bdfwbp_deposits_settings</code>).</p>\n",
